# attached, as transcribed in test/fw/test_usb_otg.py (PULLED, PU_*) and docs/internals.md#otg-host-power. Four ID lows
# after VBUS left: (1) 2.15 s after, 4.28 s long before stock's bus power came on and held it low; (2) 7.02 s after,
# 3.21 s before stock's power; (3) 5.37 s after that power's end, 2.15 s uncut; (4) after a laptop's cable, 2.15 s
# uncut. Assumed: a cable in before each unplug (the log's earlier rows are not in the repo), online 1 with it and 0
# without (the log has no online field), stock's power off 0.44 s after the ID high in (1) (its next pass) [E].
